{"seq":1,"slug":"kotlin-toolchain-build","title":"Kotlin Toolchain 与构建配置","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/kotlin-multiplatform/engineering/kotlin-toolchain-build","wordCount":602,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"kotlin-toolchain-与构建配置\">Kotlin Toolchain 与构建配置</h1><p>KMP 项目的构建系统正在经历从&quot;Gradle 配置地狱&quot;到&quot;声明式统一入口&quot;的转型。2026 年，JetBrains 将 Amper 正式并入 Kotlin Toolchain 并推进到 Alpha 阶段——通过一个 <code>kotlin</code> 命令统一 <code>build/run/test/publish</code> 流程，用 YAML 声明替代冗长的 Gradle 脚本。同时，传统的 Gradle + KMP 插件仍是生产项目的主力选择。理解两条路径以及它们的取舍，是 KMP 工程化的第一步。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>KMP 构建配置的演进可以用三代方案来理解：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[Gradle + KMP Plugin 当前主力] --&gt; B[Kotlin Toolchain Alpha 未来方向]&#10;    A --&gt; C[Convention Plugins 中间方案]&#10;&#10;    subgraph Gradle 生态&#10;        A&#10;        C&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 新生态&#10;        B&#10;    end\">flowchart LR\n    A[Gradle + KMP Plugin 当前主力] --&gt; B[Kotlin Toolchain Alpha 未来方向]\n    A --&gt; C[Convention Plugins 中间方案]\n\n    subgraph Gradle 生态\n        A\n        C\n    end\n    subgraph 新生态\n        B\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方案</th>\n<th>配置语言</th>\n<th>成熟度</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Gradle + KMP Plugin</td>\n<td>Kotlin DSL (<code>.kts</code>)</td>\n<td>Stable</td>\n<td>生产项目、复杂自定义</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Convention Plugins</td>\n<td>Kotlin DSL</td>\n<td>Stable</td>\n<td>多模块统一配置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Kotlin Toolchain</td>\n<td>YAML (<code>module.yaml</code>)</td>\n<td>Alpha</td>\n<td>新项目、简单配置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Version Catalogs</td>\n<td>TOML</td>\n<td>Stable</td>\n<td>依赖版本集中管理</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"gradle-kmp-插件配置\">Gradle + KMP 插件配置</h2><p>当前生产项目的标准配置方式。一个典型的 KMP 模块 <code>build.gradle.kts</code> 结构如下：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// shared/build.gradle.kts&#10;plugins {&#10;    alias(libs.plugins.kotlinMultiplatform)&#10;    alias(libs.plugins.androidLibrary)&#10;    alias(libs.plugins.composeMultiplatform)&#10;    alias(libs.plugins.composeCompiler)&#10;    alias(libs.plugins.kotlinSerialization)&#10;}&#10;&#10;kotlin {&#10;    androidTarget {&#10;        compilations.all {&#10;            kotlinOptions.jvmTarget = &quot;17&quot;&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    listOf(iosArm64(), iosSimulatorArm64()).forEach { target -&gt;&#10;        target.binaries.framework {&#10;            baseName = &quot;Shared&quot;&#10;            isStatic = true&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    jvm(&quot;desktop&quot;)&#10;&#10;    sourceSets {&#10;        commonMain.dependencies {&#10;            implementation(compose.runtime)&#10;            implementation(compose.foundation)&#10;            implementation(compose.material3)&#10;            implementation(libs.ktor.client.core)&#10;            implementation(libs.kotlinx.serialization.json)&#10;            implementation(libs.kotlinx.coroutines.core)&#10;        }&#10;        androidMain.dependencies {&#10;            implementation(libs.ktor.client.okhttp)&#10;            implementation(libs.androidx.activity.compose)&#10;        }&#10;        iosMain.dependencies {&#10;            implementation(libs.ktor.client.darwin)&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;android {&#10;    namespace = &quot;com.example.shared&quot;&#10;    compileSdk = 35&#10;    defaultConfig.minSdk = 24&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// shared/build.gradle.kts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>plugins {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    alias(libs.plugins.kotlinMultiplatform)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    alias(libs.plugins.androidLibrary)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    alias(libs.plugins.composeMultiplatform)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    alias(libs.plugins.composeCompiler)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    alias(libs.plugins.kotlinSerialization)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>kotlin {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    androidTarget {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        compilations.all {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            kotlinOptions.jvmTarget = \"17\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    listOf(iosArm64(), iosSimulatorArm64()).forEach { target -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        target.binaries.framework {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            baseName = \"Shared\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            isStatic = true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    jvm(\"desktop\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    sourceSets {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        commonMain.dependencies {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            implementation(compose.runtime)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            implementation(compose.foundation)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            implementation(compose.material3)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            implementation(libs.ktor.client.core)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            implementation(libs.kotlinx.serialization.json)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            implementation(libs.kotlinx.coroutines.core)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        androidMain.dependencies {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            implementation(libs.ktor.client.okhttp)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            implementation(libs.androidx.activity.compose)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        iosMain.dependencies {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            implementation(libs.ktor.client.darwin)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>android {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    namespace = \"com.example.shared\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    compileSdk = 35</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    defaultConfig.minSdk = 24</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"kotlin-toolchain-原-amper\">Kotlin Toolchain（原 Amper）</h2><p>从 0.11 版本开始，Amper 被并入 Kotlin Toolchain。核心变化是：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>命令入口从 <code>amper</code> 统一为 <code>kotlin</code></li>\n<li>IDE 插件从 Amper 切换为 Kotlin Toolchain 插件</li>\n<li>支持发布 JVM 库到 Maven Central（KMP 库发布仍在开发中）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>同样的 KMP 项目用 <code>module.yaml</code> 配置：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# shared/module.yaml&#10;product:&#10;  type: lib&#10;  platforms: [android, iosArm64, iosSimulatorArm64, jvm]&#10;&#10;dependencies:&#10;  - io.ktor:ktor-client-core:3.1.1&#10;  - org.jetbrains.kotlinx:kotlinx-serialization-json:1.8.1&#10;  - org.jetbrains.kotlinx:kotlinx-coroutines-core:1.10.1&#10;&#10;dependencies@android:&#10;  - io.ktor:ktor-client-okhttp:3.1.1&#10;&#10;dependencies@ios:&#10;  - io.ktor:ktor-client-darwin:3.1.1&#10;&#10;settings:&#10;  compose: enabled&#10;  kotlin:&#10;    serialization: json\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># shared/module.yaml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">product</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">lib</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  platforms</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">android</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">iosArm64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">iosSimulatorArm64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">jvm</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">dependencies</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">io.ktor:ktor-client-core:3.1.1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">org.jetbrains.kotlinx:kotlinx-serialization-json:1.8.1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">org.jetbrains.kotlinx:kotlinx-coroutines-core:1.10.1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">dependencies@android</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">io.ktor:ktor-client-okhttp:3.1.1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">dependencies@ios</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">io.ktor:ktor-client-darwin:3.1.1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">settings</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  compose</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">enabled</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  kotlin</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    serialization</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">json</span></span></code></pre></div><p>对应的命令：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# Gradle 世界&#10;./gradlew :shared:build&#10;./gradlew :shared:iosSimulatorArm64Test&#10;&#10;# Kotlin Toolchain 世界&#10;kotlin build&#10;kotlin test --platform iosSimulatorArm64&#10;kotlin run --platform jvm&#10;kotlin publish mavenCentral  # 仅 JVM lib\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Gradle 世界</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">./gradlew</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> :shared:build</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">./gradlew</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> :shared:iosSimulatorArm64Test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Kotlin Toolchain 世界</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kotlin</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> build</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kotlin</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> test</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --platform</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> iosSimulatorArm64</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kotlin</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> run</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --platform</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> jvm</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kotlin</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> publish</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> mavenCentral</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # 仅 JVM lib</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"version-catalogs-依赖管理\">Version Catalogs 依赖管理</h2><p>无论使用 Gradle 还是 Kotlin Toolchain，版本管理都建议集中化：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"toml\" data-code=\"# gradle/libs.versions.toml&#10;[versions]&#10;kotlin = &quot;2.3.10&quot;&#10;compose-multiplatform = &quot;1.11.1&quot;&#10;ktor = &quot;3.1.1&quot;&#10;kotlinx-serialization = &quot;1.8.1&quot;&#10;kotlinx-coroutines = &quot;1.10.1&quot;&#10;room = &quot;2.7.1&quot;&#10;&#10;[libraries]&#10;ktor-client-core = { module = &quot;io.ktor:ktor-client-core&quot;, version.ref = &quot;ktor&quot; }&#10;ktor-client-okhttp = { module = &quot;io.ktor:ktor-client-okhttp&quot;, version.ref = &quot;ktor&quot; }&#10;ktor-client-darwin = { module = &quot;io.ktor:ktor-client-darwin&quot;, version.ref = &quot;ktor&quot; }&#10;kotlinx-serialization-json = { module = &quot;org.jetbrains.kotlinx:kotlinx-serialization-json&quot;, version.ref = &quot;kotlinx-serialization&quot; }&#10;kotlinx-coroutines-core = { module = &quot;org.jetbrains.kotlinx:kotlinx-coroutines-core&quot;, version.ref = &quot;kotlinx-coroutines&quot; }&#10;&#10;[plugins]&#10;kotlinMultiplatform = { id = &quot;org.jetbrains.kotlin.multiplatform&quot;, version.ref = &quot;kotlin&quot; }&#10;composeMultiplatform = { id = &quot;org.jetbrains.compose&quot;, version.ref = &quot;compose-multiplatform&quot; }&#10;composeCompiler = { id = &quot;org.jetbrains.kotlin.plugin.compose&quot;, version.ref = &quot;kotlin&quot; }&#10;kotlinSerialization = { id = &quot;org.jetbrains.kotlin.plugin.serialization&quot;, version.ref = &quot;kotlin&quot; }\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># gradle/libs.versions.toml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[versions]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>kotlin = \"2.3.10\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>compose-multiplatform = \"1.11.1\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>ktor = \"3.1.1\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>kotlinx-serialization = \"1.8.1\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>kotlinx-coroutines = \"1.10.1\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>room = \"2.7.1\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[libraries]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>ktor-client-core = { module = \"io.ktor:ktor-client-core\", version.ref = \"ktor\" }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>ktor-client-okhttp = { module = \"io.ktor:ktor-client-okhttp\", version.ref = \"ktor\" }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>ktor-client-darwin = { module = \"io.ktor:ktor-client-darwin\", version.ref = \"ktor\" }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>kotlinx-serialization-json = { module = \"org.jetbrains.kotlinx:kotlinx-serialization-json\", version.ref = \"kotlinx-serialization\" }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>kotlinx-coroutines-core = { module = \"org.jetbrains.kotlinx:kotlinx-coroutines-core\", version.ref = \"kotlinx-coroutines\" }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[plugins]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>kotlinMultiplatform = { id = \"org.jetbrains.kotlin.multiplatform\", version.ref = \"kotlin\" }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>composeMultiplatform = { id = \"org.jetbrains.compose\", version.ref = \"compose-multiplatform\" }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>composeCompiler = { id = \"org.jetbrains.kotlin.plugin.compose\", version.ref = \"kotlin\" }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>kotlinSerialization = { id = \"org.jetbrains.kotlin.plugin.serialization\", version.ref = \"kotlin\" }</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"convention-plugins-多模块统一\">Convention Plugins 多模块统一</h2><p>大型项目通过 <code>buildSrc</code> 或 <code>build-logic</code> 模块封装重复配置：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// build-logic/src/main/kotlin/kmp-library-convention.gradle.kts&#10;plugins {&#10;    id(&quot;org.jetbrains.kotlin.multiplatform&quot;)&#10;    id(&quot;com.android.library&quot;)&#10;}&#10;&#10;kotlin {&#10;    androidTarget { compilations.all { kotlinOptions.jvmTarget = &quot;17&quot; } }&#10;    iosArm64()&#10;    iosSimulatorArm64()&#10;    jvm(&quot;desktop&quot;)&#10;}&#10;&#10;android {&#10;    compileSdk = 35&#10;    defaultConfig.minSdk = 24&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// build-logic/src/main/kotlin/kmp-library-convention.gradle.kts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>plugins {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    id(\"org.jetbrains.kotlin.multiplatform\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    id(\"com.android.library\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>kotlin {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    androidTarget { compilations.all { kotlinOptions.jvmTarget = \"17\" } }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    iosArm64()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    iosSimulatorArm64()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    jvm(\"desktop\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>android {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    compileSdk = 35</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    defaultConfig.minSdk = 24</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[build-logic 模块] --&gt; B[kmp-library-convention]&#10;    A --&gt; C[kmp-app-convention]&#10;    A --&gt; D[compose-convention]&#10;&#10;    B --&gt; E[:shared:core]&#10;    B --&gt; F[:shared:data]&#10;    C --&gt; G[:androidApp]&#10;    D --&gt; H[:shared:ui]\">flowchart TD\n    A[build-logic 模块] --&gt; B[kmp-library-convention]\n    A --&gt; C[kmp-app-convention]\n    A --&gt; D[compose-convention]\n\n    B --&gt; E[:shared:core]\n    B --&gt; F[:shared:data]\n    C --&gt; G[:androidApp]\n    D --&gt; H[:shared:ui]</pre><p>使用时只需一行：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// shared/core/build.gradle.kts&#10;plugins {&#10;    id(&quot;kmp-library-convention&quot;)&#10;}&#10;// 只需声明此模块特有的依赖，通用配置已由 convention 提供\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// shared/core/build.gradle.kts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>plugins {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    id(\"kmp-library-convention\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 只需声明此模块特有的依赖，通用配置已由 convention 提供</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"gradle-与-kotlin-toolchain-的选择\">Gradle 与 Kotlin Toolchain 的选择</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>判断维度</th>\n<th>选 Gradle</th>\n<th>选 Kotlin Toolchain</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>生产稳定性</td>\n<td>需要</td>\n<td>Alpha 可接受</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自定义构建逻辑</td>\n<td>复杂（插件、Task）</td>\n<td>简单</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>已有 Gradle 生态</td>\n<td>已投资</td>\n<td>新项目</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>团队 Gradle 经验</td>\n<td>丰富</td>\n<td>希望避免</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>IDE 支持</td>\n<td>完整</td>\n<td>持续改善中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>发布 KMP 库</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n<td>暂不支持</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>现阶段的务实建议：新建内部应用可以尝试 Kotlin Toolchain 以评估体验；对外发布的库和已有生产项目继续使用 Gradle + Convention Plugins。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Gradle + KMP 插件是当前生产标准，通过 Convention Plugins 管理多模块复杂度</li>\n<li>Kotlin Toolchain（原 Amper）进入 Alpha，提供 <code>kotlin</code> 统一命令和 YAML 声明式配置</li>\n<li>Version Catalogs（<code>.toml</code>）是版本集中管理的事实标准</li>\n<li>Kotlin Toolchain 的目标是成为 Kotlin 的 <code>cargo</code>/<code>dotnet</code>——统一构建、测试、发布入口</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"ios-integration-xcode\">iOS 集成与 Xcode 互操作</a>——构建系统如何输出 iOS Framework</li>\n<li><a href=\"testing-ci-strategies\">测试策略与持续集成</a>——CI 环境中的构建配置</li>\n<li><a href=\"../android-development/build-and-release/gradle-fundamentals\">Android 开发：Gradle 基础</a>——Gradle 核心概念的详细讲解</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Kotlin Toolchain 与构建配置","id":"kotlin-toolchain-与构建配置"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Gradle + KMP 插件配置","id":"gradle-kmp-插件配置"},{"level":2,"text":"Kotlin Toolchain（原 Amper）","id":"kotlin-toolchain-原-amper"},{"level":2,"text":"Version Catalogs 依赖管理","id":"version-catalogs-依赖管理"},{"level":2,"text":"Convention Plugins 多模块统一","id":"convention-plugins-多模块统一"},{"level":2,"text":"Gradle 与 Kotlin Toolchain 的选择","id":"gradle-与-kotlin-toolchain-的选择"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"自适应布局与导航","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/kotlin-multiplatform/ui/adaptive-layout-navigation"},"next":{"title":"iOS 集成与 Xcode 互操作","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/kotlin-multiplatform/engineering/ios-integration-xcode"}}